        "Every Cavalry unit gains Fast (1).",
        "Those squadrons gain Wings of Night: Outflank."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "At least two Outrider or Scimitar squadrons are required.",
        "No Heavy Assault, Armour, Heavy Transport or War Engine units.",
        "Squadrons with Wings of Night may not Charge in the first turn."
